James 2:1 , It is not agreeable to Christian profession to regard the rich, and to despise the poor brethren;
James 2:13 , rather we are to be loving and merciful;
James 2:14 , and not to boast of faith where no deeds are;
James 2:17 , which is but a dead faith;
James 2:19 , the faith of the devils;
James 2:21 , not of Abraham;
James 2:25 , nor Rahab.
